<title>UK: Bass confirms talks with Bristol.</title>
<headline>Bass confirms talks with Bristol.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bass Plc on Monday confirmed it is in talks with Bristol Hotel Co regarding the possible acquisition of owned and managed Holiday Inn full-service hotels in North America.</p>
<p>Bass said it would make no further comment until the discussions are concluded.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
